<title>UK: BFG Hypo sets 150 mln mark October 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>BFG Hypo sets 150 mln mark October 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sal-Oppenheim.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BFG HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.0	 MATURITY   *17.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.65    PAY DATE  S-17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   1.75</p>
<p> NOTES     *TO 17.OCT.97 THEN IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p>		STEPS-UP TO 4.6 PCT.</p>
<p>	    S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
